  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EDU - Data Ecosystems for Development in Education (DECODE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(USAID Bureau for Inclusive Growth, Partnerships, and Innovation (IPI)):  The new DECODE award is the follow-on activity to Data and Evidence for Education Programming (DEEP). This award will continue to support USAID efforts to increase the availability, quality, and use of secondary data in the education sector. This activity will include a focus on improving the relevance of available secondary data to local partners by advancing norms around localization of evidence and strengthening of local, regional, and global evidence ecosystems.</narrative>
  </description>
